<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher on Friday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 35.06 to 7921.82. For the week, the Dow gained 26.01 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.85 to 478.12.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.17.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1,720 to 1,069.</p>
<p>Volume was 499,879,790 compared with 551,273,980 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,696,379,790 shares.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
